      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like it\u0027ll work. As an aside, we should adjust the conditional where `pd_is_battery_capable` compares against to match the other battery percentage limits. Right now it\u0027s tied to a Try.Src threshold, but if I recall correctly we\u0027re disabling Try.Src entirely. I think it\u0027d be better if that threshold matched the state of charge at which we would start to shut the system down.\n\nLet me know your thoughts.",
      "revId": "c05c7eb83717de5809fcf83582a5efe7345394ab",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a7b8d257_c6a2c757",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1287197
